  <jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:12pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;【株式の種類等】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;text-indent:9pt;"&gt;会社法第155条第７号に該当する普通株式の取得&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;"&gt;(1)【株主総会決議による取得の状況】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;"&gt;(2)【取締役会決議による取得の状況】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:24pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
